  "declared_question": "Which admitted response-potency, toxicity and exposure measurements cover each parent compound, and which endpoint families remain unmeasured?",
  "excluded_by_design": [
    "any blended or weighted score across endpoint families",
    "any performance estimate or clinical efficacy, toxicity or exposure inference",
    "any claim that endpoint families can be combined into a single ranking",
    "treating an unmeasured family as safe, clean or bioavailable",
    "pooling censored bounds with point values or treating response potency as a target-independent effect"
